<div class="sr-only">
  <h1>About Rose City Robotics</h1>
</div>

<!-- Mission -->
<div id="our-mission" class="mt-32 overflow-hidden sm:mt-40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl sm:px-6 lg:flex lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-12 gap-y-16 lg:mx-0 lg:min-w-full lg:max-w-none lg:flex-none lg:gap-y-8">
      <div class="lg:col-end-1 lg:w-full lg:max-w-lg lg:pb-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-xl leading-8 text-gray-600 mt-6">Make battery disassembly safe, scalable, and worth doing.</p>
        <div class="mt-10 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-700">
          <p>Rose City Robotics is a battery recycling research company in Portland, Oregon. By 2040 the world will discard roughly 20 million tons of EV batteries a year. Most still hold about 80% of their capacity. We build robotic systems that take packs apart instead of shredding them — recovering modules and cells for second life, producing cleaner feedstock for recyclers, and keeping people out of the hazard zone.</p>
          <p class="mt-6">In 2026 the U.S. Department of Energy named us a winner of the Lithium-Ion Battery Recycling Prize Breakthrough Contest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-end gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:contents">
        <div class="w-0 flex-auto lg:ml-auto lg:w-auto lg:flex-none lg:self-end lg:pb-8">
          <img src="<%= relative_url('/images/lab_wide_rig.jpg') %>" alt="" class="aspect-[7/5] w-full md:w-[37rem] max-w-none rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 object-cover" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

