<!-- Values -->
<div id="our-values" class="mx-auto mt-40 max-w-7xl sm:px-6 sm:mt-40 lg:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Our Values</h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">We believe battery research should be honest about what it can do, grounded in peer-reviewed science, and built to keep people safe.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl sm:mt-20 lg:mt-24 lg:max-w-none">
    <dl class="grid max-w-xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">Safety</dt>
        <dd class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">
          <p class="flex-auto">No person belongs next to a pack in thermal runaway. We design the human out of the hazard zone first, and optimize everything else second.</p>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">Science</dt>
        <dd class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">
          <p class="flex-auto">We publish what we learn, build on peer-reviewed research, and validate with national laboratory partners. Claims on this site trace back to our DOE prize application.</p>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <dt class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">Circularity</dt>
        <dd class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">
          <p class="flex-auto">A battery that still holds 80% of its capacity isn't waste. We recover modules, cells, and components for second life before anything is recycled — and what is recycled arrives as cleaner feedstock.</p>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Company -->
<div id="our-company" class="mt-32 overflow-hidden sm:mt-40 mb-40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl sm:px-6 lg:flex lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-12 gap-y-16 lg:mx-0 lg:min-w-full lg:max-w-none lg:flex-none lg:gap-y-8">
      <div class="lg:col-end-1 lg:w-full lg:max-w-lg lg:pb-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">Our Company</h2>
        <p class="text-xl leading-8 text-gray-600 mt-6">Battery recycling research, based in Portland, Oregon.</p>
        <div class="mt-10 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-700">
          <p>Rose City Robotics is an Oregon corporation based in Portland. Our disassembly research combines teleoperated robotics with transformer-based imitation learning, developed with partners including Oak Ridge National Laboratory, Portland State University, Loupe Robotics, and Polaris Battery Labs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-end gap-6 sm:gap-8 lg:contents">
        <div class="w-0 flex-auto lg:ml-auto lg:w-auto lg:flex-none lg:self-end lg:pb-8">
